[01:06.75] You want to string me around
[01:12.08] But you lead me nowhere
[01:17.23] You want to see me drown
[01:22.32] Claw the surface for air
[01:26.04] But you're not there
[01:31.35] 
[01:53.50] You steal the dreams from my sleep
[01:58.58] And leave the darkness to bear
[02:03.77] What more you need to keep?
[02:09.02] What more can't I share?
[02:12.83] It's not fair
[02:16.73] 
[02:59.72] You turn your eyes from mine
[03:04.51] Glance if you dare
[03:09.69] In the wintertime
[03:14.51] The cold will freeze our stares
[03:17.93] But we won't care
[03:22.37] 